        "body": "Boston Dynamics is a public company founded in 1992 and headquartered in Waltham, Massachusetts, United States. On its own site the company describes itself as a leading global robotics company that builds practical robotics to tackle automation challenges and change ideas of what robots can do. The site also points readers to white papers and eBooks about the development, implementation, and value of robots and automation solutions.\n\nThe site names one product, Stretch, presented for streamlining case handling and warehouse automation. The company describes Stretch as easy to deploy and flexible, and says it keeps operations moving.\n\nThe record also lists Massachusetts as a location of law exposure, with a count of 191. No products beyond those above, lawsuits, or MCP servers are listed.",
